  method = "UNIVERSE h1283 numpy module mesh + FAITHFUL IIT4 (hexa-lang/stdlib/consciousness/iit4/faithful_phi.hexa, exact MIP-EI n=4). Frozen-first, NOT tune-to-green: every round honored the ΔΦ≥+0.02-every-seed bar verbatim; bar NEVER moved to manufacture GREEN (c9). RED ⇒ NO engine-native wiring (a_verified_must_wire fires only on GREEN) — verified an expressiveness wall is NOT the cause (engine CAN express reciprocal-update pub fns); it is a verification wall (mirror result not robust enough to promote). Baseline guards stay green on the UNTOUCHED engine. Toy scope, scale UNVERIFIED."
  verdict = "🔴 CLOSED-NEGATIVE / 🧱 WALL (R5 terminal; R1 🟠 PARTIAL ladder) — winner-broadcast lifts ACCESS/coherence but is a sub-bar, seed-dependent lever for IRREDUCIBLE Φ integration; broadcast topology FALSIFIED, bar unmoved, NO wiring (a_paper_negative_ok) — .verdicts/1283_thalamus_global_workspace/H_1283_R5.txt"
  group  = "BRAIN-STRUCTURE-LADDER"

@C h1284_neuromodulation_gain := "H_1284 — NEUROMODULATION (state-driven adaptive gain / regime-switching control over decode + memory) is INERT-or-HARMFUL vs a single best-fixed point — NO FREE LUNCH is GENERAL — 🧱 WALL (closed-negative)" :: hypothesis [slug=1284_neuromodulation_gain group=BRAIN-STRUCTURE-LADDER]
